  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: '"You cast an invisibility spell over yourself and the cat. You approach
    the dragon quietly, pulling the dagger from your belt. As you approach the dragon''s
    belly, she appears to be looking for you. You stab into the dragon''s belly with
    the dagger and slash open her belly, dumping her intestines to the ground. She
    attempts to swipe at you, missing due to your invisibility.'
